# Ruby, Daring Tracker: "{T}: Add {R} or {G}." Hasty on turn 1, she can't tap for white, blue, black or colourless; tapped for red she
# pays for Lightning Bolt (Bot2 at 17). On turn 3 she taps for green and pays for Giant Growth on herself (a 4/5 until end of turn);
# attacking is no longer possible once she is tapped, so Bot2 stays at 17.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Ruby, Daring Tracker
Lightning Bolt
Giant Growth
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

